  "body": "## Summary\n\nCleans up baggage from a stale design. The `tofu-plan-apply-template` in pipeline-templates already curls both `shared-providers.tf` AND `.terraform.lock.hcl` from `infra-bootstrap/main/tofu/provider/` at init time, so anything committed locally is silently overwritten and never matters at runtime. The per-repo `tofu-lockfile-check` / `tofu-lockfile-update` workflows validate / regenerate a file that does not influence runtime.\n\nAuthoritative source for the shared lockfile is now [infra-bootstrap/tofu/provider/.terraform.lock.hcl](https://github.com/nelsong6/infra-bootstrap/blob/main/tofu/provider/.terraform.lock.hcl), gated by infra-bootstrap's own `Check Tofu Lockfile` workflow.\n\nSame cleanup landing across all sibling repos with the same files (auth, kill-me, plant-agent, investing, my-homepage, glimmung).\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Next tofu PR in this repo plans cleanly using the shared lockfile (no missing-lockfile error)\n- [ ] `Check Tofu Lockfile` check is no longer present on this repo's PRs (workflow removed)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
  "changed_files": 3,
